 piring artists who adopt him as an elder statesman\, flattering him but al
 so causing him to question their authenticity.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cin
 ema/in-theaters/late-fame\n\nEstimated start: 19:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
